// AST_Node#drop_side_effect_free() gets called when we don't care about the value,
// only about side effects. We'll be defining this method for each node type in this module
//
// Examples:
// foo++ -> foo++
// 1 + func() -> func()
// 10 -> (nothing)
// knownPureFunc(foo++) -> foo++

